R_PROC, DURATION))\n    print(\"downloads=%s bytes=%s errors=%s\" % (tc, tb, te))\n    print(\"throughput_mbps=%.2f\" % (tb*8/DURATION/1e6))\n```\n\nThe timing: each process sleeps DURATION then stops. Processes start roughly together. Total ~12s. Good, within 30s timeout.\n\nLet me log round 2 first, then write round 3.\n\nRound 2 reward: RTT 0.073, improved from 0.044. Good direction. Log it.", "refusal": null}
